# BuildKit reads `<dockerfile>.dockerignore` beside the Dockerfile in preference to the
# context root's `.dockerignore`. This file carries, verbatim, the rules the repository
# root `.dockerignore` held until 2026-09-08 — they were written for THIS image and for no
# other. Keeping them here leaves the controller image's build context byte-for-byte what
# it has always been, while the root file becomes ordinary repository-wide excludes so
# that every other root-context build (the Symbol-U API from the root `Procfile`, among
# them) can see the repository at all. See
# docs/audits/ugence_governance_studio_p3e/BUILD_CONTEXT_EXCLUSION_DEFECT.json.

# Ignore everything except what the controller needs
*
!symbolu/
!symbolu/**
!deploy/gke/requirements-controller.txt

# Re-exclude non-controller symbolu subpackages to keep image small
symbolu/experimental/
symbolu/mechanical/
symbolu/core/
symbolu/robotics/
symbolu/__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
*.egg-info/

# Dev/CI files
.git/
.github/
tests/
scripts/
docs/
benchmarks/
artifacts/
results/
configs/
data/
frontend/
examples/
*.md
*.json
*.jsonl
Procfile
